    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9120ed8fcf7a5891ce306086",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『百花杯』是1800米的GⅢ比赛。\n作为三后冠首战，樱花赏『的前哨战』\n它的距离偏长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e06670bf9f4cf9bb628252ca74902bd9b3e0f03a04d4c5f4ef2be1bc9884b932",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
