    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e007ffc5792cacc391e90b7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥的目标是达成三后冠。\n尤其『橡树大赛』绝不能缺席。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aab865bd32733b56a6144ad4d813236466fe7863af0c834e1ca3e9999a1cc612",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
